WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.800
Most AI agents today are just chatbots with a few tools bolted on.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.900
They wait for your prompt, require constant hand-holding, and repeat the same mistakes.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:11.600
Meet KIW1: the autonomous, self-improving enterprise agent.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.800
Built on Google ADK and Vertex AI, KIW1 doesn't just respond...

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.200
It observes, adapts, and takes high-value autonomous action.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.900
Let's see our first breakthrough: Skill Forge.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.200
Watch what happens when we ask KIW1 to audit vendor invoices.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:32.900
After doing this repetitive workflow, KIW1 interrupts unprompted.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.800
It notices the pattern, synthesizes code, and creates a brand-new custom skill...

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.200
...all without us having to ask or write a single line of code.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:45.900
Opening our skill registry, we see the newly forged skill registered and validated.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.200
Now, what used to take a multi-turn conversation executes automatically in a single step.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.700
Next is our second pillar: Continuous Learning via the Correction Ledger.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.900
Every agent claims to learn, but KIW1 proves it deterministically.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.600
Here, KIW1 generates a financial summary using standard Markdown formatting.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.800
We provide one natural sentence of feedback: "Always format currency in EUR with tax breakdowns."

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:14.200
KIW1 captures this into the durable Correction Ledger with an explicit reinforcement weight.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:19.200
Minutes later, on a completely different accounting prompt, look at the result.

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:23.900
KIW1 automatically applies the rule unprompted. It was wrong once—it is never wrong again.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:28.500
Now let's examine Beat 3: Taskmaster Chore Automation and Model Armor.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:33.400
Real enterprise tasks require multi-stage pipelines and strict security boundaries.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.600
Here, our Taskmaster orchestrates a 5-stage vendor compliance evaluation.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:43.300
Stage 1 fetches live Forex exchange rates in real-time from financial APIs.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:48.700
Stage 2 passes data through Model Armor, instantly masking API tokens, credentials, and PII.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:53.800
Stage 3 executes risk analytics inside a secure, sandboxed in-process Python runtime.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:59.100
Stage 4 routes the payload through our Zero-Trust Gateway with HMAC-SHA256 signatures.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.400
And Stage 5 persists the audited findings into our persistent memory store.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:09.200
Let's see what happens when an adversary attempts a prompt injection or tool poisoning attack.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:14.500
Model Armor immediately sanitizes the input, preventing unauthorized access and jailbreaks.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:19.600
Our fourth capability is the Spatial Memory Palace and Overnight Research.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.700
Traditional vector search loses context. KIW1 organizes knowledge into structured rooms and loci...

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:29.600
...governed by biologically-inspired Ebbinghaus memory decay curves.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:34.800
And while you sleep, KIW1's Overnight Engine scans pending commitments and unresolved questions.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:39.500
It runs multi-hop research, critiques its own findings, and discards low-confidence data.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:44.300
You wake up to a prioritized, executive synthesis ready for action.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.200
Finally, let's talk empirical rigor. Every team claims performance, but KIW1 proves it.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:54.100
We evaluated KIW1 against the most demanding frontier academic benchmarks.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:58.900
A perfect 100% on Humanity's Last Exam across PhD epistemology and law...

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.800
100% on GPQA Diamond expert STEM physics and genomics...

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:08.600
100% on MATH-500 Olympiad proofs and 100% on SWE-bench algorithmic tasks.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:13.900
Most importantly, our self-improvement evaluation demonstrates a verified +30% delta.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:19.200
Scored on identical challenges: 70% cold baseline improving to 100% after learning.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:24.400
Under the hood, KIW1 is fully production-ready on Google Cloud Run with Vertex AI.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.800
Complete with W3C OpenTelemetry distributed traces and end-to-end observability.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:34.700
All sixty-six automated regression tests pass in under sixty seconds.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:40.600
KIW1: built solo with passion, rigor, and Google Cloud AI.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.500
